Primary-source documents linked from each event (the `source_url`
field) are works of their original publishers — typically U.S. or
foreign government agencies, peer-reviewed journals, or news outlets.
Those works retain their original terms and are not redistributed by
this dataset; only the links and editorial summaries are.

